[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4061058396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117414#issuecomment-4061058396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117414","id":4061058396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yDtVc","user":{"login":"anderlli0053","id":22171451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTcxNDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22171451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053","html_url":"https://github.com/anderlli0053","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anderlli0053/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-14T18:36:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T18:36:51Z","body":"I have also just now tried removing the Geometry3D from the \"disabled classes\" in the build profile, but the error persists.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4061058396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4064217817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117414#issuecomment-4064217817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117414","id":4064217817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yPwrZ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T23:57:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T00:01:08Z","body":"I confirm the issue. It's not related to script encryption, just the disabled `Geometry3D` in the build profile.\n\nError from GCC:\n```\nIn file included from main/performance.cpp:41:\n./servers/rendering/rendering_server.h:42:11: error: 'namespace Geometry3D { }' redeclared as different kind of entity\n   42 | namespace Geometry3D {\n      |           ^~~~~~~~~~\nIn file included from ./core/object/class_db.h:58,\n                 from main/performance.compat.inc:35,\n                 from main/performance.cpp:32:\n./core/disabled_classes.gen.h:144:7: note: previous declaration 'class Geometry3D'\n  144 | class Geometry3D; template <> struct is_class_enabled<Geometry3D> : std::false_type {};\n      |       ^~~~~~~~~~\n./servers/rendering/rendering_server.h:992:84: error: invalid use of incomplete type 'class Geometry3D'\n  992 |         virtual void mesh_add_surface_from_mesh_data(RID p_mesh, const Geometry3D::MeshData &p_mesh_data);\n      |                                                                                    ^~~~~~~~\n./core/disabled_classes.gen.h:144:7: note: forward declaration of 'class Geometry3D'\n  144 | class Geometry3D; template <> struct is_class_enabled<Geometry3D> : std::false_type {};\n      |       ^~~~~~~~~~\nscons: *** [bin/obj/main/performance.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.o] Error 1\n```\n\nCC @Ivorforce who forward-declared it in #115452.\n\nWorth noting that `Geometry3D` modified in #115452 is the core math class now made a namespace. But what the build profile attempts to disable is the singleton exposed through `core/core_bind.cpp` (which itself is in the `CoreBind` namespace). So the generated `disabled_classes.gen.h` might be bogus, and I'm not sure `CoreBind` singletons are correctly disabled.\n\n> I have also just now tried removing the Geometry3D from the \"disabled classes\" in the build profile, but the error persists.\n\nI can't reproduce that, removing `Geometry3D` from the build profile fixes the issue.\n\nAlso note that the issue is only in the `master` branch (the PR linked above was merged for 4.7), so if you're trying to build export templates for 4.6.1, you should check out the `4.6.1-stable` tag.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4064217817/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4064225985","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117414#issuecomment-4064225985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117414","id":4064225985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yPyrB","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco